{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815220/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.poster.avif?t=1752235004\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815220/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.webm?t=1752235004\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815220/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.mp4?t=1752235004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc8e <strong>MEET VIOLA!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A young poetess with a sultry voice and slender fingers that caress her lute strings like the hips of a lover. Her songs were as tender as spring rain kisses, her poems soaked in longing, love, and hopeless dreams. She was adored. She was betrayed. She was killed. But death didn't silence Viola\u2014it made her eternal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now she floats above the stage, wrapped in silken mist, leaving behind the scent of jasmine, vetiver, and wistful melancholy. She whispers verses into the ears of the sleeping, sings serenades in the dark, and moans in harmony with the crackle of old records. Viola doesn't just play strings\u2014she plays on nerves and hearts. This ghostly maiden seeks not just flesh, but the soul. Though, she wouldn't mind taking both...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815220/extras/13ff10285fa6df2ed932c3be3397e596.avif?t=1752235004\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcdc <strong>WHAT ELSE DO YOU GET?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By purchasing this DLC, you'll unlock Viola as your mascot! You can switch mascots anytime by opening the &quot;Mascot&quot; tab on th